Go to phys.org and search for 'fusion' using the site's search function. Return the result as a JSON object with this exact schema:

{"query": "fusion", "result_count": <integer: number of results shown on the first results page>, "first_result_title": "<exact headline of the first result>", "first_result_category": "<topic tag if visible, else null>"}

