I need the current national average retail prices from the EIA Gasoline and Diesel Fuel Update page (eia.gov/petroleum/gasdiesel/). Please report the results in this exact JSON format:

{"regular_gasoline": "$X.XX", "premium_gasoline": "$X.XX", "diesel": "$X.XX", "report_date": "YYYY-MM-DD"}

